text:
请读取以下结构化数据，说明其中有几个面板、每个面板的图表类型、类别、系列和单位。先建立数据合同，不绘图；不要合并两个面板的数据，也不要从系列名推测额外数据。

```json
{
  "dataset_id": "quarterly-sales-and-monthly-orders",
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "Quarterly Sales",
      "chart_type": "grouped_bar",
      "x_axis": {
        "label": "Quarter",
        "categories": ["Q1", "Q2", "Q3", "Q4"]
      },
      "y_axis": {
        "label": "Revenue (million USD)",
        "min": 0,
        "max": 70,
        "tick_step": 10
      },
      "series": [
        {"name": "Target", "values": [40, 55, 48, 62]},
        {"name": "Actual", "values": [36, 51, 45, 59]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Monthly Orders",
      "chart_type": "line",
      "x_axis": {
        "label": "Month",
        "categories": ["Jan", "Feb", "Mar", "Apr", "May", "Jun", "Jul"]
      },
      "y_axis": {
        "label": "Number of Orders",
        "min": 0,
        "max": 60,
        "tick_step": 10
      },
      "series": [
        {"name": "Orders", "values": [22, 28, 25, 36, 44, 41, 53]}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```
